# Canvas UI

Use when implementing visual effects, liquid/glass/particle-style surfaces, or GPU polish over copy.

- Canvas UI = aesthetic / interactive look. It does **not** replace anime.js for scroll path physics.
- Keep effects layered so storytelling copy stays readable.
- Prefer documented Canvas UI primitives over one-off WebGL unless the human asks.
